+6.  If the root check passes, call `point_locate(dest, 0, 0)` (assuming index 0 is the root) [S1][S2, unofficial].
+7.  If no common parent is found (or `point_locate` fails), return 0 or an error indicator [S1][S2, unofficial].
 
